{"id":"c12","stage":1,"title":"身体不舒服","scene":"向医生说明症状和持续时间。","roles":["医生","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c12-1","ko":"어디가 불편하세요?","zh":"您哪里不舒服？","note":"医生礼貌地询问症状。","words":[{"term":"불편하다","zh":"不舒服；不方便","id":"e3a81c369f5e123f","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/ba62c02e12a10c8842b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"어디가","meaning":"哪里","explanation":"어디（哪里）+ 가（主格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"어디가","audio":"/audio/6d28cfb014a6b7e4f086.mp3"}]},{"text":"불편하세요?","meaning":"不舒服？","explanation":"불편하다（不舒服）+ -시-（尊敬）+ -어요（礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"불편하다","audio":"/audio/e3a81c369f5e123fbec0.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c12-2","ko":"목이 아프고 기침이 나요.","zh":"我嗓子疼，还咳嗽。","note":"-고 连接两个症状。","words":[{"term":"목","zh":"嗓子；脖子","id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"},{"term":"아프다","zh":"疼","id":"912c6f176a189a34","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"},{"term":"기침","zh":"咳嗽","id":"aa2351b107c95734","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/3eee71ac92bb8da9c318.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"목이","meaning":"嗓子","explanation":"목（嗓子、脖子）+ 이（主格助词）；此处指嗓子。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}]},{"text":"아프고","meaning":"疼，而且","explanation":"아프다（疼）+ -고（并列连接）。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}]},{"text":"기침이","meaning":"咳嗽","explanation":"기침（咳嗽）+ 이（主格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"기침","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}]},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"出现","explanation":"나다（发生、出现）→ 나요；기침이 나다表示咳嗽。","readings":[{"term":"나요","audio":"/audio/ad7945a49b70f6a53963.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c12-3","ko":"언제부터 그랬어요?","zh":"从什么时候开始这样的？","note":"부터 表示起点。","words":[{"term":"부터","zh":"从……起","id":"5741caa1bef8b155","audio":"/audio/5741caa1bef8b155a2ff.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/564e1f337c04569c1308.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"언제부터","meaning":"从什么时候起","explanation":"언제（什么时候）+ 부터（起点）。","readings":[{"term":"부터","audio":"/audio/5741caa1bef8b155a2ff.mp3"}]},{"text":"그랬어요?","meaning":"这样的？","explanation":"그러다（那样做、那样）→ 그랬어요，过去礼貌形式；그랬다指上文症状。","readings":[{"term":"그랬어요","audio":"/audio/4452f4af6263d1f0ee1a.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c12-4","ko":"어제 저녁부터 그랬어요.","zh":"从昨天晚上开始的。","note":"这里省略已经说过的症状。","words":[{"term":"어제","zh":"昨天","id":"79c5ada11647bce6","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"},{"term":"저녁","zh":"晚上","id":"8d3c547011f433e6","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/c964e008270e8f1d5e93.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天","explanation":"어제修饰后面的저녁。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"},{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}]},{"text":"저녁부터","meaning":"从晚上起","explanation":"저녁（晚上）+ 부터（起点）。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}]},{"text":"그랬어요.","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"그러다的过去礼貌形式，代指前文身体不舒服的情况。","readings":[{"term":"그랬어요","audio":"/audio/4452f4af6263d1f0ee1a.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c12-5","ko":"열도 나나요?","zh":"也发烧吗？","note":"열이 나다：发烧。","words":[{"term":"열","zh":"发烧；热","id":"6f4112362e973dd6","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/132c746df9a87456bec3.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"열도","meaning":"也发烧","explanation":"열（热、发烧）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}]},{"text":"나나요?","meaning":"有吗？","explanation":"나다（出现）+ -나요（礼貌疑问）；열이 나다表示发烧。","readings":[{"term":"나나요","audio":"/audio/f7daba519bd32ddb0cd1.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c12-6","ko":"네, 체온을 재 보니 조금 높았어요.","zh":"是的，量了体温，有点高。","note":"-아/어 보니：做了之后发现。","words":[{"term":"체온","zh":"体温","id":"b2e63fe36c8e8870","audio":"/audio/b2e63fe36c8e88707bcd.mp3"},{"term":"재다","zh":"测量","id":"9d678676ecef5059","audio":"/audio/9d678676ecef505985b3.mp3"},{"term":"높다","zh":"高","id":"5601621a4a648d5b","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/2369e5e27f69bd275935.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是的","explanation":"네表示肯定。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}]},{"text":"체온을","meaning":"体温","explanation":"체온（体温）+ 을（宾格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"체온","audio":"/audio/b2e63fe36c8e88707bcd.mp3"}]},{"text":"재","meaning":"测量","explanation":"재다（测量）+ -어 → 재，与보다组成“试着量”。","readings":[{"term":"재다","audio":"/audio/9d678676ecef505985b3.mp3"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"量过后发现","explanation":"보다 + -니；-아/어 보니表示做过之后发现。","readings":[{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"有点","explanation":"조금表示程度轻。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}]},{"text":"높았어요.","meaning":"高","explanation":"높다（高）+ 过去时-았- + -어요（礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}]}]}],"day":56,"sequenceScore":1.0934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["从什么时候开始这样的？","什么时候会恢复呢？","为什么会这样呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["也咳嗽吗？","也发烧吗？","也头疼吗？"],"answer":1}]}
